[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0605","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0532","title":"FreeBSD SSH 安全绕过漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 于 2000-01-14 发布的一个 SSH 补丁中，将 SSH 服务监听端口同时配置为 22 和 722。由于该补丁的安全配置缺陷，即便网络防火墙或过滤设备对标准 SSH 端口 22 进行了访问限制，远程攻击者仍可通过端口 722 直接连接到 SSH 服务，实现安全绕过后获得未经授权的远程 shell 访问权限。该漏洞影响安装了上述补丁的 FreeBSD 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。攻击条件为目标系统运行了该版本的 SSH 且 22 端口被过滤但 722 端口可达，攻击者通过 SSH 客户端连接 722 端口即可绕过访问控制策略获取系统访问权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0532"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56.300","remediation":"立即编辑 /etc/rc.conf 或 /etc/ssh/sshd_config，删除 Port 722 监听配置，将 SSH 限制为仅在 22 端口监听；执行 /etc/rc.d/sshd restart 重启 sshd 服务；通过 netstat -an | grep 722 确认 722 端口已停止监听；在 ipfw 或 pf 防火墙规则中阻断外部对 722 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施；升级到 FreeBSD 后续修正版本以彻底消除额外端口监听问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-06/0031.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1387","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1323","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4638","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0532.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0532","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0532.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0532.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w5fx-fj77-4247/GHSA-w5fx-fj77-4247.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0532.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c77b308d-2e98-4027-a7aa-e2790abbc3f6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7d03e4f3df7d1c708e4cd65e70b5251f2830a284/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--c77b308d-2e98-4027-a7aa-e2790abbc3f6.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0605.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0447","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0447.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0559","title":"Computer Associates eTrust Intrusion Detection 管理密码弱加密漏洞","description":"Computer Associates eTrust Intrusion Detection 系统（原名 SessionWall-3）1.4.1.13 版本存在弱加密漏洞。该系统使用 XOR 异或算法对注册表中存储的管理员密码进行加密，加密强度极低。拥有本地访问权限的攻击者可轻松从注册表中提取加密后的密码，并通过逆向 XOR 算法快速还原出明文密码，进而获取系统管理员权限，对系统安全构成严重威胁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0559"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59.910","remediation":"建议升级 CA eTrust Intrusion Detection 至最新受支持版本。如已停止支持，应迁移至其他受支持的入侵检测产品；同时限制本地用户对注册表中 `HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\ComputerAssociates\\eTrust\\IntrusionDetection` 的读取权限，并使用 NTFS 权限和 BitLocker 保护存储敏感信息的系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1341","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.BSO.4.21.0006072124320.28062-100000%40bearclaw.bogus.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20012","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0559.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0559","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0559.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0559.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mfrx-mc2c-9g9w/GHSA-mfrx-mc2c-9g9w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0559.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1341/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0447.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0447.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0447.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0443","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0443.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0538","title":"Allaire ColdFusion 管理后台登录密码拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.5.1及更早版本（含2.0、3.x、4.x）的ColdFusion Administrator administrator登录界面存在输入验证不足缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向管理登录页面提交超长登录密码触发服务拒绝（DoS）。当ColdFusion Administrator处理过长的密码字段时，应用程序因未对输入长度进行有效边界检查而导致服务异常或崩溃，进而使合法管理员无法正常登录执行管理操作。该漏洞影响所有部署受影响版本ColdFusion Server的站点，攻击者无需任何凭据即可从远程发起利用，利用方式为向登录接口发送包含超长密码字段的特制HTTP请求。Allaire公司已发布安全公告及补丁修复该漏洞，建议管理员升级至修复版本或应用官方补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0538"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57.143","remediation":"升级至 ColdFusion 5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复由超长登录密码导致的管理员界面拒绝服务漏洞。如暂无法升级，应通过防火墙或反向代理限制 ColdFusion Administrator（/CFIDE/administrator）仅允许可信 IP 访问，并在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层配置规则拒绝包含超过 72 个字符密码字段的 POST 请求，同时启用管理员账户锁定策略以降低服务停止影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96045469627806&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=16122&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/3399","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1314","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4611","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19996","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0538.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4b54eaec6e1ac2fa73932c72cc91a932e04af217/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0538.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0538","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/908.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2a511a3a50683ea9152c5bacd8a2a2e417f6e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0538.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0538.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32f28e88cd643e53b067fd929c3f6aaf649f3db6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2mg9-gqjh-3ggm/GHSA-2mg9-gqjh-3ggm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-coldfusion.rules","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/cold_fusion_admin_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0443.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0443.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0443.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0433","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0433.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0520","title":"Stelian Pop dump 包 restore 子程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Stelian Pop 版本 0.4 dump 工具中的 restore 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序在处理超长磁带文件名时，由于未进行有效边界检查，导致堆栈缓冲区溢出，使攻击者能够劫持控制流并执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Stelian Pop 版本 0.4b17 及更早版本。攻击者只需在本地提供一个特定长度的磁带文件名即可触发，不需要任何身份验证即可完全破坏目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。（≈65字）","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0520"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54.720","remediation":"根据 Red Hat Bugzilla #11880 中的安全公告，建议立即升级到 Red Hat Linux 的 dump 升级版本或获取最新的 dump 软件包修复。您可以运行 \"yum update dump\" 或从 Red Hat 官网上下载并安装最新的 dump 软件包版本（当前版本高于 0.4b15-1）。如果无法立即升级，建议通过限制用户对 /tmp 目录的写权限并配置系统调用过滤器来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=11880","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96240393814071&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1330","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20004","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/266fe704c781cbc078a9ec7ea9793fb6a6392843/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0520.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0520","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/660abd3ba8b9665b75517f5af32be5415f0c15ce/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0520.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d32e0b640af59eb0eaf607a7942d5c2c21e6e8c6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0520.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6be15d5bc4d11c3f9dbcc76b2b68361cadc22974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-396q-53q6-gx75/GHSA-396q-53q6-gx75.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/a1f8b3e954dc569a9faaf2d530236d865bca3340/content/CVE-2000-0520.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0520.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dd5c5d56-d7c2-4f34-8714-7bbf334821ff.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0433.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0429","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0429.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0515","title":"惠普 HP-UX SNMPD 文件权限漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0515是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0515"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54.047","remediation":"将 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/snmpd.conf 文件权限从世界可写修改为仅管理员可写，执行 chmod 600 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/snmpd.conf。同时修正 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/ 目录权限（该目录为 777 模式），执行 chmod 750 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/。将 snmpd 进程以非 root 用户（如 snmpd 用户）身份运行，避免以 root 权限启动。升级至 HP-UX 11.0 的最新安全补丁版本，HP 官方已发布针对此文件权限问题的安全修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1327","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006070511.OAA05492%40dogfoot.hackerslab.org","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006090640.XAA00779%40hpchs.cup.hp.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4643","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20002","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2b7e39540f8003a5fc1c3ce83959dcdba6671a4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0515.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0515","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aab9feabdc7192f1040b6d0a4deb6b961232c23a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0515.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d86f1beec7ec3be149cb88607f1d8e210a5ebad3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0515.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7pwx-75rm-fxfq/GHSA-7pwx-75rm-fxfq.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0515.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0515.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4fb9def3-4814-451d-9cb3-eef0e78269d2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0429.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0611","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0611.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0534","title":"FreeBSD apsfilter 本地代码执行漏洞","description":"apsfilter 是 FreeBSD ports 包中的打印过滤器软件，在处理用户过滤器配置文件时存在安全缺陷。由于未正确验证和解析用户提供的过滤器配置，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意配置文件，以 lpd 守护进程用户的身份执行任意命令。攻击者需要具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致权限提升或敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0534"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-07","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 系统到包含修复补丁的版本，或从 FreeBSD ports 中更新 apsfilter 到最新版本，确保用户过滤器配置被正确解析并限制 lpd 用户的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T06:09:34.878747048+00:00","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1389","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1325","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4617"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0611.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1208","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0558","title":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager 6.1 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager 6.1 版本存在代码执行漏洞，攻击者可通过向监听在端口2345 的 OVALARMSRV 报警服务发送特制数据包触发严重缓冲区溢出，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞无需任何身份验证即可利用，攻击者可直接在网络环境中实施攻击，完全掌控目标系统，窃取敏感数据，破坏系统完整性并导致核心服务瘫痪。该漏洞影响 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 6.1 版本。通过搜寻相关报道发现该漏洞已针对企业网络管理系统的广泛部署造成了严重威胁，需要用户尽快安装安全补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0558"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59.787","remediation":"建议立即升级 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 至 6.2 或更高版本（HP 已发布补丁修复 Alarm 服务缓冲区溢出）。若暂无法升级，请在防火墙层面封禁 2345 端口（OVALARMSRV 端口），并限制仅允许受信管理 IP 访问该端口，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0249.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1317","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0558.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0558","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0558.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0558.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cmmr-4624-8pv4/GHSA-cmmr-4624-8pv4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0558.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0567","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0567.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0503","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01 的 WebBrowser 控件中 IFRAME 组件存在跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页触发 NavigateComplete2 事件，绕过跨框架安全策略访问其他框架的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 5.01 版本，CVSS 评分 2.6（AV:N/AC:H/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），攻击复杂度高、需用户交互、仅影响机密性。攻击者需诱导受害者访问恶意页面触发 NavigateComplete2 事件，可读取跨域框架内容导致信息泄露。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议升级至 IE 5.01 SP1 或更高版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0503"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52.427","remediation":"立即停止使用 IE 5.01 及其所有版本，建议迁移到 IE 6+ 及以上版本或现代浏览器（Chrome/Firefox/Edge），并强制执行 ActiveX 和脚本控制策略以缓解此类漏洞风险","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q2/0154.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1311","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0503.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0503","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0503.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0503.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3h8r-hv7f-jgcx/GHSA-3h8r-hv7f-jgcx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0503.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0503.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3a0b52cf-134d-48c7-bede-e123a8ac7cdd.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0567.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0567.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0445","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0445.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0552","title":"Mirabilis ICQ 2000.0 A Mailclient 临时文件权限设置不当漏洞","description":"Mirabilis ICQ 2000A Webmail 客户端在用户登录过程中会创建一个全局可读的临时文件且登录后未删除，导致本地用户可通过读取该临时文件获取敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Mirabilis ICQ 2000A 版本的 Webmail 客户端，CVSS 评分 5.5（中危），攻击向量为本地访问（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），需要低权限（PR:L），无需用户交互（UI:N），机密性影响高（C:H）。攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限，即可读取登录过程中遗留的临时文件获取敏感信息（如会话凭据等）。Mirabilis 已在后续版本中修复此临时文件未清理问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0552"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58.990","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 ICQ 2000.0 A 并升级至现代即时通讯软件（如 QQ、微信、Telegram 等）。若必须在旧系统运行，请在系统临时目录设置严格权限（chmod 700 /tmp），并定期清理临时文件防止敏感信息泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0237.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1307","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4607","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19993","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0552.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0552","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0552.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0552.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icq_vulns.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-55c6-r3wh-x7cj/GHSA-55c6-r3wh-x7cj.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icq_installed.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0445.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0435","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0435.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0523","title":"Etype Eserv FTP服务日志堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"EServ 2.9.2 及更早版本的 FTP 服务器在日志记录功能中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当攻击者向目标服务器发送超长的 MKD（创建目录）FTP 命令时，由于日志模块未对输入长度进行有效校验，导致写入数据超出预分配缓冲区边界，覆盖相邻内存区域。经认证的远程攻击者可精心构造恶意 MKD 命令载荷，控制溢出数据覆写返回地址，从而在服务器进程上下文中执行任意系统命令，获取完全控制权。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，属于最高危害等级，影响 EServ 2.9.2 及其之前所有版本，攻击者无需特殊权限即可实现远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0523"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55.100","remediation":"立即将 EServ 升级至 2.9.2 之后的修复版本（如 EServ 3.x），若新版本不再可用则应彻底停用 EServ 并替换为仍在维护的代理服务器软件（如 Squid、Nginx）。升级前可先在防火墙或路由器上限制对 EServ 管理端口（默认 21/80/8080）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以阻断远程 MKD 命令的攻击路径。同时检查服务器日志中是否存在异常超长 MKD 请求记录，若已被利用须立即排查后门和数据泄露情况。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0009.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1315","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4614","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19997","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0523.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0523","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0523.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0523.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pg42-38hv-3f6h/GHSA-pg42-38hv-3f6h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0523.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ad8e88eb-8f78-44fd-af04-96c18c56afb8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0435.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0430","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0430.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0516","title":"Intel Shiva Access Manager 5.0 LDAP密码明文存储泄露漏洞","description":"Intel 公司 Shiva Access Manager 5.0.0 在配置为将配置信息存入 LDAP 目录时，会将 LDAP 根 DN（可分辨名称）及其密码以明文形式写入全局可读（world-readable）的本地文件。本地攻击者无需特权即可读取该文件获取 LDAP 管理员凭据，进而完全控制 LDAP 服务器，导致机密性、完整性与可用性全面受损。该漏洞影响运行于 Solaris 上的 Shiva Access Manager 5.0 相关部署，攻击条件为本地可访问目标主机且产品启用 LDAP 配置存储；利用方式为直接读取含明文密码的配置文件并使用所得凭据接管 LDAP。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0516"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54.187","remediation":"1. 立即修改受影响配置文件的权限，将 $SHIVA_HOME_DIR/insnmgmt/shiva_access_manager/radtac.ini 的访问权限收紧为仅 root 用户可读写：以 root 身份执行 chmod 600 $SHIVA_HOME_DIR/insnmgmt/shiva_access_manager/radtac.ini 并确认文件属主为 root:root，防止本地任意用户读取其中以明文存储的 LDAP root DN 名称及密码。2. 将 radtac.ini 中记录的 LDAP 密码修改为复杂度足够的高强度密码，同时同步更新 LDAP 服务器上的对应凭据，确保在文件权限修复前泄露的密码不再有效。3. 审计系统中是否存在其他由 Shiva Access Manager 生成的明文配置文件（如 $SHIVA_HOME_DIR/insnmgmt/shiva_access_manager/ 下的所有 ini 文件），一并收紧权限并清除其中不必要的敏感信息。4. 由于 Intel Shiva Access Manager 已于多年前停止维护且未发布任何补丁，强烈建议将远程访问认证、授权及计费功能迁移至当前仍在维护的替代产品（如 FreeRADIUS、OpenAM 或商用 IAM 解决方案），从根本上消除因产品停更导致的安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0008.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1329","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4612","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20003","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5b3647aa8630e92d52def237a668e1c7c212a696/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32