用户名，触发缓冲区溢出导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 Cmail 2.4.7 版本的 Web 管理接口，攻击者只需网络访问权限即可发起攻击，无需任何认证凭据，利用方式为向用户登录对话框发送超长用户名字符串触发缓冲区溢出导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于网络可访问、低复杂度、无需认证的可用性部分影响漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0556"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59.517","remediation":"立即升级 cmail 到最新维护版本或使用支持安全补丁的分支，因为原始 2.4.7 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。防火墙配置中添加端口 8002 入站规则限制访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并限制用户名长度到合理范围，防止非法大用户名溢出攻击。同时，应在服务器上部署 IDS/IPS 系统，检测对端口 8002 的异常流量并及时阻断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0248.html","http://www.computalynx.net/news/Jun2000/news0806200001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1319","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4625","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0556.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0556","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0556.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0556.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqgq-47w7-8ccc/GHSA-mqgq-47w7-8ccc.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0556.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0556.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c78208cf-9dd7-40da-844c-85a22cce8fba.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0645.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0626","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0626.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0544","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0/2000 DCE/RPC SMBwriteX 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"该漏洞利用存在于 Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 操作系统的 DCE/RPC 请求机制中的 SMBwriteX 函数的整数缓冲区溢出。攻击者可通过精心构造的数据长度异常的 SMBwriteX 请求，触发 RPC 服务的整数下溢，导致内核关键数据结构损坏或堆栈破坏，最终引发系统拒绝服务，导致目标主机蓝屏崩溃或重新启动。该漏洞对未进行身份验证的远程攻击者完全可用，无需任何权限，攻击过程为单步骤，攻击条件宽松，成功率较高，影响范围广泛，涵盖所有运行 Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 的网络主机。由于Windows NT 4.0和Windows 2000系列操作系统已停止服务和支持，此漏洞仍可能存在于Legacy系统或企业内部网络中，已经成为企业内部网络安全重大隐患。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0544"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57.897","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-066 提供的安全补丁：Windows NT 4.0 需安装 Service Pack 6a 并应用补丁 Q272133；Windows 2000 需安装 Service Pack 2 及后续安全更新。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面封锁 TCP 135、139、445 端口（DCE/RPC 和 SMB 端口）作为临时缓解措施，并禁用不必要的 SMB 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0231.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1304","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0544.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0544","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0544.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0544.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063e